                                                "example_id": "29459872-bb3b-4f17-b620-088a22beff4b",
                                                "sense_id": "ee6c3549-7caa-3ad4-bf01-10ae535a5a76",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless, the comprehensive comparative analysis of pumpkin viromes across various geographic regions by NGS remains deficient."
